2835+ 6A9F              .dir_search_len_ge2:
2836+ 6A9F                      ; Is the LAST byte of the name still inside the same physical window?
2837+ 6A9F                      ; last = HL + BC - 1
2838+ 6A9F                      ; Carry means that the name crosses #FFFF -> #C000, therefore use the
2839+ 6A9F                      ; fully bank-safe (but slower) routine below.
