8578+ 82B6              ; data_available_in_module_file:
8579+ 82B6              ; NZ/NC = HL available data (clamped to download_length).
8580+ 82B6              ; Z/NC = closed socket with no queued bytes; Z/C = user pressed B.
8581+ 82B6              ; Temporary emptiness is paced and retried, never treated as EOF.
8582+ 82B6              ; Empty polls wait until data, confirmed closure or B; AT query replies remain bounded.
